<title>JAPAN: O S Co to issue 30 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>O S Co to issue 30 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - O S Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Bank Switzerland</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   30 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 21.Nov.00</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>EXER FROM 28.Nov.96  EXER TO 14.Nov.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 21.Nov.96  INT PAY 21.Nov</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 6.Nov.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on November 6.</p>
</text>
